- [ ] [useRaceStore.ts](file:///c:/Users/rnasy/Desktop/Typeracing/src/store/useRaceStore.ts) compiles with new fields, [resetStore()](file:///c:/Users/rnasy/Desktop/Typeracing/src/store/useRaceStore.ts#68-69) clears them
- [ ] `multiplayerApi.ts` exports all 6 methods with correct type signatures
- [ ] [GameState](file:///c:/Users/rnasy/Desktop/Typeracing/src/store/useRaceStore.ts#3-4) type includes `WAITING_FOR_GUEST`, `LOBBY_FULL`, `READY_CHECK`
- [ ] **Verification:** `pnpm build` passes (type-check only, no runtime validation yet)

