### Step 5.2 — Modify [ResultsModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rnasy/Desktop/Typeracing/src/components/ResultsModal.tsx)

**Rationale:** The existing modal is solo-focused. Multiplayer needs: winner/loser framing, opponent comparison, and persistence status feedback.

#### Updated Props Contract

```typescript
interface ResultsModalProps {
  isOpen: boolean;
  isLoading: boolean;
  results: FinishResponse | null;
  onReset: () => void;
  // New multiplayer props
  isMultiplayer?: boolean;
  isWinner?: boolean;               // winnerId === userId
  opponentWpm?: number;
  persistenceStatus?: PersistenceStatus;
}
```

#### UI Additions

| Condition | Rendered Element |
|-----------|-----------------|
| `isMultiplayer && isWinner` | "VICTORY" banner with green glow |
| `isMultiplayer && !isWinner` | "DEFEAT" banner with red accent |
| `persistenceStatus === 'SAVING'` | Spinner in place of "Stats Synchronized" badge |
| `persistenceStatus === 'SAVED'` | "Stats Synchronized" badge (existing) |
| `persistenceStatus === 'ERROR'` | "Save Failed — stats won't appear on profile" warning |
| `opponentWpm` present | Side-by-side WPM comparison card |

