## Execution Order Summary

| Order | Phase | Files Touched | Depends On |
|-------|-------|---------------|------------|
| 1 | Phase 1 | [useRaceStore.ts](file:///c:/Users/rnasy/Desktop/Typeracing/src/store/useRaceStore.ts), `multiplayerApi.ts` | Nothing (foundation) |
| 2 | Phase 2 | `useLobbyPolling.ts`, `RacePage.tsx` | Phase 1 (store + API) |
| 3 | Phase 3 | `ReadyUpOverlay.tsx`, `RacePage.tsx` | Phase 2 (lobby polling provides state) |
| 4 | Phase 4 | [useRaceSync.ts](file:///c:/Users/rnasy/Desktop/Typeracing/src/hooks/useRaceSync.ts) | Phase 2 (Hook Handover switch) |
| 5 | Phase 5 | `RacePage.tsx`, [ResultsModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/rnasy/Desktop/Typeracing/src/components/ResultsModal.tsx) | Phase 4 (FINISHED state from sync) |

> [!TIP]
> **Parallelism opportunity:** Phase 3 (UI components) and Phase 4 (sync hook changes) can be done in parallel since they don't touch the same files. The critical path is: Phase 1 → Phase 2 → Phase 5.
